  "text": "A man goes to the doctor. He says, \"Doctor, I have a big problem. I forget everything!\"\n\n\"Oh,\" says the doctor. \"Since when?\"\n\n\"Since when what?\" says the man.\n\nThe doctor writes some notes. \"Sit down, please. First, what is your name?\"\n\nThe man thinks hard. \"I do not know. Can I phone my wife?\"\n\nThe doctor laughs. \"Okay. Here is the phone.\"\n\nThe man calls his wife. \"Hello, dear. What is my name?\" He listens. Then he smiles and says to the doctor, \"It is Peter! And my wife says, 'Come home, the dinner is ready!'\"",
